Quest 725 "[Lemegeton] Endless Path"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900243000
    Collect 1 of 900244000

Requires (player level >= 72 and player is karus and quest 723 is completed) or (player level >= 72 and player is elmorad and quest 724 is completed)

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Man, I should have asked him where hidden treasures are. Oh well, let's just go to Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] to seal the devils."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Man, I should have asked him where hidden treasures are. Oh well, let's just go to Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] to seal the devils."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [20Devil] Purson and [44Devil] Shax."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. Your last work was great."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Please give me the seal Scroll that you will seal in your body, then, <selfname>.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [20Devil] Purson and [44Devil] Shax."

On in_progress
    Say "Where is the seal Scroll?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. With this seal Scroll, the soul of devil will be locked in this ring."

On completed
    Say "This devil will be a difficult one to fight against. It's notorious [Devil 32] Asmodeus, who is said to have both angel and demon sides. He's very particular. We've given up on him completely. I'm asking you to fight against him since you're the only one who can destroy him, <selfname>. Additionally, please seal [Devil 56] Gremory and [Devil 70] Seere, who are following him."
